   "road": null,
   "overview": "Take the Vesper summit trail, then bear right off trail to the first ridge notch and scramble a ledge to its end. Expect class 4 for the first two pitches, then class 5 for three. Pitch it, or just scramble, as far as a small ledge. The third pitch moves left across and up a corner rated 5.5-5.6 to a belay. The fourth is slab again (5.5). The final pitch is low angle on the face but runout.",
